
## Deployment Checklist

Now you can build and push:

```bash
# 1. Create directory and files
mkdir ajn-rss-viewer
cd ajn-rss-viewer

# 2. Create all files above (copy each content)

# 3. Initialize git
git init
git add .
git commit -m "Initial commit: RSS viewer with XSLT"

# 4. Create repo on GitHub first, then push
git remote add origin https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/YOUR_REPO_NAME.git
git branch -M main
git push -u origin main
